  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "内置编辑器组合八个阵营的效果与关键词，生成数百亿种平衡卡牌",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With the in-game Cards Editor , you can combine the effects and keywords of 8 different Factions to create balanced cards that make your deck, and strategy, truly unique. With more than 27 billions combinations at your disposal, you'll never run out of options!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3833620/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "神明为同阵营牌提供被动，完成局内小任务才能召唤传奇单位翻盘",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The God is the \"leader” of the deck, and provides passive bonuses to all cards of its Faction. Legends are powerful units that you can summon by completing some \"mini-quests\" during the match, and they can suddenly turn the tides of the battle with their extreme effects.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3833620/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "回合保持全程互动，可针对对手每次行动即时打牌回应",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Cards are auto-balanced (i.e. no \"I win\" card), and immediately available worldwide to all players that want to unlock them. Also every turn is interactive, and you can play cards as a response to each of your opponent's actions",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3833620/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
